WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.730
Welcome to Seventies Sound.

00:00:01.730 --> 00:00:05.960
This is a short introduction to music from the nineteen seventies.

00:00:05.960 --> 00:00:08.619
Start with pop, glam rock or disco.

00:00:08.619 --> 00:00:13.330
Each section introduces an artist and gives you a song to try.

00:00:13.330 --> 00:00:19.810
Read the short introduction, open the extra facts, then follow a listening link to explore the music.

00:00:19.810 --> 00:00:23.995
You can suggest another artist or topic on the Request page.

00:00:23.995 --> 00:00:28.250
This is a starting point, so there is more music to discover.

